      <title>The Star Wars Hanukkah Special! (Story of Chanukkah and parody of the Star Wars Holiday Special)</title>
      <description>The Star Wars Hanukkah Special! A parody of both The Star Wars Holiday Special (an actual 1978 Star Wars made-for-TV movie) and the story of Chanukkah (or Hanukkah). The rebels of the planet Judea are trying to liberate their planet from Jabba the Hutt. Includes new songs, Princess Leia, space battles and more! Written, directed and edited by David Kasdan. Starring Bruno Garibay as Menorah. David Kasdan is Jabba the Hutt, the padawan and a soldier. Amanda Guest is a soldier; Jami Robins is Princess Leia. Also Diana Rodriguez, Laura Terry, Dan Schley; Eric Kragenbrink as the narrator. Filmed by Moses Rodriguez and David Kasdan. Costume design by Jami Robins with props provided by Michael Stinton. Filmed at Kehilat Ariel Messianic Synagogue in San Diego. Additional background music Smoking Gun by Kevin MacLeod. The video uses the traditional Jewish song "Mi Y'malel" and Rock of Ages. Here are the lyrics for Rock of Ages: Rock of Ages let our song Praise thy saving power; Thou amidst the raging foes; Was our sheltering tower Furious they assailed us, But Thine arm prevailed for us, And Thy word broke their sword, When our own strength failed us. Enjoy more videos at youtube.com/brokentitle.</description>
